  "html": "<p>上週五12/13 由施劭儒執行長帶隊前往苗栗-裕隆車之道體驗中心參訪。</p>\n<p>參觀了實際在組裝車輛的車裝工場，了解整個生產線流程。</p>\n<p>而值得一提的是，裕隆在一條生產線上可以同時生產不同車種，比單一組裝的難度更高喔!</p>\n<p>更多照片請至<u><strong><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pg/EMRDofNTUST/photos/?tab=album&amp;album_id=2418517665128487&amp;__xts__%5B0%5D=68.ARCE2PO1e-n-Sddr-qfLjMobu9aLHc_Rdv2pBihuwyHYkZf0aRzErnhFQgqihLpOA1QDnJb0ryDdgotyEfngcWIUmR_njOY71OauOxzoDiFKMI3CwuF3nY806Bi6mVyT7IdLrdppu1q8u2gdyqEYA_aMW-_H6jai5lZIEwyxAXaa-HvL0kkSdZfiA6NHGYcAG6laSVILHZXw0RJ5a8sLa8W9LWwi4tSzzArifLRfH4uJTDgOM9UQTvCFhKz-MDY_DbTekfJulzT_vrCL9zYtfw2RvbO94_pF5kp0cElUH7rLQLAhwsiLUNZSQGFO-Q4UkzDcPYZORvBeFnILTTKZqtr2WGdns2xQ0XBdrmmSENpcUMSx-P7b95T9An3A1Nmek_3XK6cUubpDa8djGTVfizRu0HWEoPe2nO65fkhoHFOzaRRCNm0w98hBXybb9zm3y1JBaaGIzY1mEY44C_4Pdo086w&amp;__tn__=-UC-R\" title=\"p\">FB相簿</a></strong></u>觀看</p>\n<p><img alt=\"108.12.13 裕隆車之道體驗中心參訪\" height=\"488\" src=\"/legacy/img/777ccd1170-641469119.jpg\" width=\"650\"></p>",
